        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Match-Guide-foster-orgs.dita" xtrc="li:14;66:13">Two meals daily of dry kibble</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Match-Guide-foster-orgs.dita" xtrc="li:15;67:13">Likes yogurt, peanut butter, broths, and watermelon</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Match-Guide-foster-orgs.dita" xtrc="li:16;68:13">Fast eater and drinker (slow feeder recommended)</li>
