        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Match-Guide-foster-orgs.dita" xtrc="li:19;78:13">Protective instincts; good alertness</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Match-Guide-foster-orgs.dita" xtrc="li:20;79:13">Needs structured walks and mental games</li>
